WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.030
A man makes about 100 million sperm a day.

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.800
A woman releases only about
400 eggs in her whole lifetime.

3
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:14.130
And every egg-forming cell she will
ever have was made before she was born.

4
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.220
Both kinds of gamete come from
the same division: meiosis.

5
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.820
In a testis, one meiosis gives four sperm.

6
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.410
In an ovary, just one egg.

7
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.750
Why the difference?

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.380
In this mission, you'll compare
how sperm and eggs are made,

9
00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.580
by the numbers.

10
00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:34.720
Then you'll test what you have learned
on a very different kind of cell.

11
00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:38.600
Your mission: explain why
meiosis gives four sperm,

12
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.050
but just one egg.
